  "description": "Adds items from Riot Games (LoL/TFT/Arena) to Teamfight Manager 2. Includes tfm2_item_tactics (by tfm2mods): a fourth item slot, with the fourth item chosen by the game's own recommendation network. The fourth slot needs game 0.5.3 exactly and is off by default — set 'slots = 4' in 4items.cfg to enable it.",
